Source: aayushi-code
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Aayushi Code Project <aayushi-code@example.com>
Package: aayushi-code
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31)
Recommends: fonts-noto-core
Description: Aayushi Code - a lightweight, ultra-fast code editor
 Aayushi Code is a free and open-source text editor written in Lua, on top
 of a small C core using the SDL library. A fork of Lite XL, it bundles
 language servers, syntax highlighting and web development tooling for many
 programming languages out of the box.
